    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on that webcomic, our\u00a0favorite\u00a0duo,\u00a0<strong>Pain 'n Dave</strong> (Mostly Pain), have found themselves in a diabolical dimension called the Maze of Malice! Shoot and dodge your way out in this charming top-down <i>2D arcade shooter.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAMPAGE</strong>\u00a0through 5 different levels in the Maze of Malice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong>\u00a0over 15 different kinds of enemies and other weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTROY</strong>\u00a0your foes with 4 unique power-ups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER</strong>\u00a0over 10 achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOGIE</strong>\u00a0to an energetic soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the Maze of Malice?!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on that webcomic, our\u00a0favorite\u00a0duo,\u00a0<strong>Pain 'n Dave</strong> (Mostly Pain), have found themselves in a diabolical dimension called the Maze of Malice! Shoot and dodge your way out in this charming top-down <i>2D arcade shooter.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAMPAGE</strong>\u00a0through 5 different levels in the Maze of Malice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong>\u00a0over 15 different kinds of enemies and other weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTROY</strong>\u00a0your foes with 4 unique power-ups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER</strong>\u00a0over 10 achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOGIE</strong>\u00a0to an energetic soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the Maze of Malice?!</p>",
